{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents24OUDSLegacyLayoutModifierV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)"]},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"text":" flag is read and OUDS considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and OUDS cannot only rely on the OS version."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus, this "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"},{"type":"text","text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"**You must use this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"text":" to YES **.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"  flag."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["  OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier())"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since","type":"aside"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier/init()":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"init()","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier\/init()","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Instanciates the "},{"code":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and displays error messages in the standard output"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","title":"Components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic","image